'''Decidueye ex''' (Japanese: '''ジュナイパーex''' ''Junaiper ex'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 2 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

